# Things 4 Good

> Things 4 Good is the Thingelstad family's annual handmade-candle fundraiser in Minneapolis. Since {{ metrics.perYear[0].year }} the family has hand-poured wooden-wick candles for a fall sale; every candle is a ${{ site.pricePerCandle }} donation, and 100% goes to the non-profits the four family members pick each year. That has added up to ${{ metrics.grandTotalDisplay | safe }} for {{ metrics.orgCount }} organizations.

The {{ site.saleYear }} sale is {{ site.saleDates | safe }} in Minneapolis. Buyers at the sale split their donation across that year's four causes (preorders are divided evenly); the family covers the materials. Preorders, meant for orders of six or more, stay open until the sale ends and are picked up anytime during it. Hours and the address are sent by email, never posted. {% if causes.list.length %}This year's four causes{% if causes.list.length < 4 %} so far{% endif %}: {% for c in causes.list %}[{{ c.name | safe }}]({{ c.url }}) ({{ c.who }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.{% if causes.list.length < 4 %} The rest are announced {{ causes.announce }}.{% endif %}{% else %}This year's four causes are announced {{ causes.announce }}.{% endif %} Per-non-profit amounts on the site are estimates; each sale's total is exact.

## Pages

- [Home](https://things4good.xyz/): the fundraiser, how it works, the makers and the sale dates
- [Candles](https://things4good.xyz/candles/): this year's scents, the XL size and the candle lid
- [Impact](https://things4good.xyz/impact/): every non-profit supported, filterable by who picked it and by event
- [Numbers](https://things4good.xyz/stats/): dollars raised, candles sold, growth by year and candle math
- [Preorder](https://things4good.xyz/preorder/): preorder steps, pickup and payment methods
- [Pay](https://things4good.xyz/pay/): Venmo, Cash App, Zelle and Apple Pay with pay buttons and QR codes, plus cash and check
- [Candle care](https://things4good.xyz/care/): how to burn a wooden-wick candle, the same tips as the card that comes home with every candle
- [FAQ](https://things4good.xyz/faq/): how it works, what it costs and where the money goes
{%- if site.makerNight %}
- [Maker Night](https://things4good.xyz/maker-night/): an evening for six on {{ site.makerNightDate }}, {{ site.makerNightTime | safe }}; a seat is one of six gold Maker Night candles, a ${{ site.makerNightDonation }} donation at the sale (or by preorder), at most two per person, divided evenly across the four causes. Guests get a thank-you candle and pour four of their own in any scents from the library. {% set seatsLeft = makerNightSeats.total - makerNightSeats.sold %}{% if seatsLeft > 0 %}{{ seatsLeft }} of {{ makerNightSeats.total }} seats left{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}
{%- endif %}

